{
  "name": "ondra-trust-dashboard",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的信任读数（L9 扩展池）：把「她有多信你」拆成五项可核对的读数（信任 / 亲密 / 熟悉 / 承诺履约率 / 记忆存量），每一项都标出取自哪个服务的哪个字段，读不到的项显示为「读不到」而不用 0 顶替。只做只读投影：不自算信任分（那会多出三个真源）、不做界面（归应用外壳）、不写任何上游（契约里连 adjust 都不镜像）、不报比例不评价不鼓励（会被当成评分系统）。五项上游全是软依赖，缺哪项就在 missing 里点名。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
